WEBVTT

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.830
The spirit, Aria...

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:14.080
Aria, go to Level 59.

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:17.420
There, you should find the answer to what you seek.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:23.750
Level 59 is uncharted territory for the Loki Familia.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.080
What could be down there?

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.380
We've got to go, no matter what happens.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.000
Alongside Miss Ais and the others.

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:56.130
Tarinai mono sagashi utsumuitara

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:59.830
Konna suteki na basho ni deaenai

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:06.130
Aimai na monosashi wa mou shimaou

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:11.170
Yuuki ga ichimen hirogaru kara

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.710
Hitomi ni wa uso no nai ima ga utsutte

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:20.920
Iranai tsuyogari o sutete

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:25.540
Issho ni naki egao ni narou

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:31.580
Hajiite sorezore no speed de suki na you ni kazatta

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:36.540
Kimi ga ireba kiseki mo okiru RE-ILLUSION

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.210
Terashiai kagayaite

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:43.960
Sono saki de yume to yume mazariatte

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:46.210
Soujou kouka o unde

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:53.920
Shoushin shoumei no katai kizuna de sekai watatta

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:07.830
B-Bell.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.080
Goddess.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.460
This is a warning, Sword Princess.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.710
Stop sticking your nose where it doesn't belong.

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.420
What do you mean?

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:38.290
We mean be a good girl
and stay in the Dungeon, Dollface.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:43.580
If you get in our Lady's way... you're dead.

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:53.460
Man, I thought we were goners back there!

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:56.920
I guess it's a good thing they decided to retreat.

00:02:57.380 --> 00:03:00.920
But danger sure does like to follow your Familia around.

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:02.960
I'm sorry...

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:08.830
G-Goddess, that's enough, don't you think?
We're all safe and sound now.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.670
If you say so, Bell.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.920
Thank you for today.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.210
I'll see you tomorrow, then.

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:20.130
Sure. See you tomorrow.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.420
Time to go home, Bell!

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.710
To OUR home that we SHARE!

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.830
That ambush...

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.460
I'm almost positive it was Vana Freya and the Bringar.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.920
From the Freya Familia...

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:40.830
But why?

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:45.080
A warning, huh?

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:51.960
And you're sure it was Vana Freya and the Bringar?

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:52.880
Yes.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.920
Actually, I have some curious news as well.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:01.790
Ottarl's been seen in the middle levels
hunting down monsters.

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:03.210
King?

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:06.500
He's not the type to get involved in schemes,

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:10.040
so I didn't think it would impede our expedition.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.080
But this changes things a bit.

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:18.670
You don't think the Freya Familia has
anything to do with the recent incidents, do you?

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:20.750
I highly doubt it.

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:24.630
Freya's probably stewin' up somethin' of her own.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.420
Her own plan?

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:31.420
Freya aside, we know somebody on the surface
has been communicatin' with the enemy.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:34.710
Just wish we'd have known who it was
before the expedition!

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.830
Yeah...

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.580
What are you two doing?

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.040
Boob exercises!

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:50.000
Fels.

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:58.210
Do we have eyes on the Loki Familia
and their expedition?

00:04:58.420 --> 00:04:59.790
All taken care of.

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:04.420
Now to see if they can make it down
to Level 59 in one piece...

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:08.080
They'll make it.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.540
Is that your godly intuition?

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:17.420
Well, there's no guarantee...
But I'm confident they'll get there.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.420
Thou art master of the bow.

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:24.960
Fire, O Elven archer!

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:27.750
May your arrow strike true!

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:29.500
Arcs Ray!

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:41.960
Amazing, Lefiya. You can do Concurrent Chanting now.

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:45.460
It's all thanks to all of you.

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:49.750
You and Miss Filvis have taught me so much!

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:54.960
The expedition's tomorrow.
Should we head home a little early?

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:59.000
Um, Miss Ais...

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:05.380
Um, how is the special training going with that Human?

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:10.710
He's putting in a lot of effort.
About the same as you are, Lefiya.

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:14.380
Oh, I see.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:20.080
Miss Ais! I'm gonna stay here
and train by myself for a little longer!

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:23.750
I want to be able to help out the group
on our expedition this time!

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:27.670
Sure. Don't overdo it, okay?

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:29.790
Okay!

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:36.540
Being about the same isn't good enough.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.250
There's no way I'm gonna lose to that Human!

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.130
Come on!

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.330
Hurry it up!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.630
Can't you go faster?

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:47.330
All right, you're done! Next!

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:48.460
Thank you!

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:52.540
All right, you're done! Next!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:53.790
Thank you!

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:57.880
Dammit, I don't even have time to cop a feel!

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:01.880
This is why I tell you guys every time,
come and get your Status checked early!

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:05.670
I freakin' hate expeditions!

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:07.960
There she goes again.

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:11.630
It's starting to feel more and more like an expedition.

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:13.920
This time more than usual, I'd say.

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:17.210
I'm sure they're all eager to put their training to the test.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.670
Ais' Rank-Up has had a big influence on everyone.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:25.540
I was a little worried they might overdo it,
but it seems I worried for nothing.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:28.710
Yes, morale is higher than ever.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:34.540
But gods, have they all grown.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:37.830
Even Raul and Lefiya are getting up there now.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:42.130
I remember when it was just the three of us
back in the early days.

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:46.670
Don't even think about retiring yet, Gareth.

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.250
We've finally made it.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:55.920
A journey into the uncharted territory
that Zeus and Hera left behind.

00:07:56.460 --> 00:08:00.670
If we succeed, our names will echo across the land.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.750
As far as my Prum brethren, no doubt.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.250
Still not enough renown for you?

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.790
There's not a Prum in the world
who doesn't know your name.

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:13.630
It won't stop here.

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:16.750
I'll keep moving forward,
no matter what the path ahead may bring.

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:21.960
Finn, you haven't changed a bit since the day I met you.

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:27.170
Your ambition has always been greater
than the length of your arm,

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:30.250
and not once have you been afraid to speak on it.

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:33.500
Strange, isn't it?

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:36.210
To think that we're now on the forefront
of Dungeon exploration

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:38.750
when all we used to do is bicker with each other.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:42.420
All right, let's bring it in.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.330
I'm gettin' fired up.

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:46.830
To a passionate battle.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.790
To a world yet unseen.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.750
To the revival of a race.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.750
Gareth, I'm counting on you to lead the second group.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:56.960
Right. We'll take it easy and head out as usual.

00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:59.670
It'll be a good measure of how Lefiya has grown.

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:01.670
Godspeed.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.750
It's gotten so late already!

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:16.750
I'm not gonna lose to you!

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:19.040
Huh?

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:43.580
That's the first time you were able to counterattack.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.170
Yeah.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:48.580
Today is our last session.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.710
Thank you for everything this past week.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.830
And thank you.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:56.710
I enjoyed it.

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:59.960
Anyway, do your best.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:02.880
Right. And you, Miss Ais... Um...

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.790
Do your best.

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:21.080
I need to improve the way he does...

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:25.630
Hey, Sword Princess!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:30.500
Long time no see. Been taking care of yourself?

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:34.210
Yes. We are thankful to have you with us.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:36.500
Indeed. Good to be here.

00:10:36.790 --> 00:10:38.880
No need to be so stiff, though.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:42.380
We blacksmiths came because we wanted to.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:45.250
Oh, there you are, Bete Loga!

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:52.040
You're dead meat if you ruin your Flosvirt again
after all it took me to do that emergency repair. Got it?

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:55.210
I got it! Now get the hell outta my face!

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:01.000
Lulune? What are you doing here?

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:02.750
I came to see you off.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:06.080
In return for all those times you rescued me.

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:10.830
These are portable rations
I like to take on my deeper excursions!

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:11.540
For you.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:12.290
Thank you.
For you.

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:18.750
It's from Black Cloak.

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:23.790
Supposedly you should wear it when you go to Level 59.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.960
Well, I'll let you decide whether to use it or not.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.920
But I really did come to see you off, you know!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:35.380
Let's grab a drink when you get back!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:41.170
Good, it looks like you got to see Miss Lulune.

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:42.330
Lefiya...

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:46.130
She gave me one of those portable rations too.

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:50.290
She was looking for you, so I was wondering
if she found you in the end.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:52.170
Thanks.

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:56.000
You're in the first group to depart, aren't you?

00:11:57.710 --> 00:12:01.080
I'll be following right behind you.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:07.040
The time has come to set off
on our expedition into the deep levels!

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:11.750
We'll be splitting into two groups
to avoid causing chaos on the upper levels.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.540
I'll be leading Group 1, and Gareth Group 2.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:19.420
The smiths of Hephaistos Familia
will be joining us as well.

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:24.460
We'll regroup on Level 18,
and then head straight to Level 50.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:30.540
Our destination is none other
than the uncharted ground of Level 59.

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:33.210
Expedition forces, let's march!

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:34.290
Yeah!

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:42.790
I can't believe we got the smiths
from the Hephaistos Familia to come with us!

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:48.000
Well, it was a big favor we asked of them.
See to it you're on your best behavior.

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:50.790
You'd better be. If you embarrass the boss,

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:54.500
I'll never forgive you!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:56.540
I know, I know.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:13:01.040
Seriously, never ever ever...

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:05.290
Huh? You all right over there?

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:07.750
Th-there's a Minotaur back there!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:11.330
No doubt about it!

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:14.790
There's a Minotaur wielding a huge sword on Level 9!

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:19.080
In any case, I'm glad you're all right.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:20.460
Did you see any other Adventurers?

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:23.580
One on his own, attacked in a room further back...

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.670
By now, that white-haired kid's gotta be...

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:28.170
Hey, Ais!

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:29.960
Hey! We're on an expedition!

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.710
That was a Minotaur bellow.

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:35.960
It's faint, but I can hear it!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:39.170
I just can't tell which way with all this echoing.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.330
Miss... Adventurer...

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:46.380
Please... Save him.

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.540
What happened? Just hold on!

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:55.670
Please... Save Master Bell...

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:58.670
Sword Princess...

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:03.540
King...

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:04.750
Ottarl!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.540
I challenge you to a duel.

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:12.750
Why? Why here and now?

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:16.790
I ran into a member of a rival Familia in the Dungeon...

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.750
Is that not enough to warrant a fight to the death?

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:21.790
Could this be...

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.330
This is a warning, Sword Princess.

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.960
...what they meant by that warning?

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:36.080
If I'm about to face the only Lv.7 in all of Orario...

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:39.580
I don't have time to think about that right now!

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:42.420
Tempest!

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:44.460
Out of my way!

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:56.630
You're slow...

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:01.630
But I see you've grown stronger.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.500
What is this pressure?! It's not just the level difference...

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:09.920
It's him. The King's strength as a warrior.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:13.380
At this rate, that boy won't survive!

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:19.330
Loki Familia?

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:20.080
Now!

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:24.500
Who do you think you're pointin' your sword at,
you goddamn Boar!

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.330
Ais, wait!

00:15:28.330 --> 00:15:29.750
Hey, wait up!

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:32.960
Hello, Ottarl.

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:36.710
Finn?

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:41.290
I never would have guessed
it would be you holding us up here.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:42.830
Can I ask why?

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.670
I don't need a reason to fight.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:49.540
And I didn't pick this time or place for any reason either.

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:51.040
Quite right.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:55.170
Am I to understand, then,
that this is the will of your Familia?

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:58.790
Does the goddess Freya wish to provoke
an all-out war between us?

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.460
I'll ask you again.

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:06.000
Was this the will of Lady Freya?

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:11.960
I act on my own accord.

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:22.630
Riveria, what is her condition?

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.420
I've stabilized her.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:28.040
She must have been desperate to find help.

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:32.000
Please...

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:36.080
Master Bell... Save Master Bell...

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:51.750
Are you all right?

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:54.920
You did your best. I'll take it from here.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.790
There you are. Ais!

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:05.380
What are you doing?

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:12.630
I can't...

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:19.290
I can't be rescued by Ais Wallenstein anymore!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:49.290
Well, I guess stealing someone's prey
in the Dungeon would be breaking the rules.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:52.790
Wait, isn't that Tomato Guy?

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:57.540
Wow, this guy's a freakin' Minotaur magnet!

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:59.250
You mean, he's the one Ais rescued before?

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:04.960
Yeah. The Minos must love Tomato Guy so much
that they come up from the middle levels to see him.

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:06.210
Bete, stop being stupid.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:10.040
Anyway, he doesn't want any help.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:15.250
Not from the girl he made
such a fool of himself in front of last time.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:32.460
You're going?

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:36.630
Don't get me wrong. I don't like savin' little punks.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:41.290
But I REALLY don't wanna be reduced to some bully
who just harasses people weaker than him.

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:43.710
Stand aside, Ais. I'll take care of it.

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:53.000
Are you sure he's a Lv.1?

00:18:53.630 --> 00:19:00.000
A month ago, that boy was a total amateur
in your eyes, Bete. Am I wrong?

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:03.000
What the hell happened to him?

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:12.880
This is his. His adventure.

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:14.750
He's like the Argonaut.

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:18.250
The story of the boy who longed to be a hero.

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:20.880
I always loved that story too.

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.130
Firebolt!

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:26.710
The look of a hero...

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.960
Firebolt!

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:06.750
Firebolt!

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:18.250
FIREBOLT!

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:31.790
Incredible...

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.130
I've never seen anything like that before.

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:43.210
The Adventurer, Bell Cranel.

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:55.500
Riveria, Ais!

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:56.920
What happened?!

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:58.960
I'll explain later. We'll be right back!

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.380
They were in a rush.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.460
Yes...

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:13.750
What could have happened?

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:22.330
Bell!

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:28.330
I've been so worried about you...

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:32.960
So it was you two who rescued him...

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:35.710
All we did was carry him back here.

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:39.170
This boy took down the enemy alone,
with nothing but his own strength.

00:21:47.960 --> 00:21:50.830
Thank you. Both of you.

00:21:55.210 --> 00:22:00.790
It seems this expedition may turn out
to be a bit different from usual...

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:10.580
Ohayou mado o akete

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:14.040
Doko e datte ikerunda

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:17.920
Kibou wa itsumo sasayaita

00:22:17.920 --> 00:22:21.920
Doko made mo aruitekou

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:28.670
Narabete kurabete tameiki tsuite

00:22:28.670 --> 00:22:35.040
Wakatteru wakatteru

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.580
Yasashisa to ka nukumori to ka

00:22:43.580 --> 00:22:47.290
Kimi datte ano ko datte

00:22:47.420 --> 00:22:54.000
Itsuka kitto ai o shirunda

00:22:54.000 --> 00:23:01.080
Asu no kimi ga kyou no kimi o

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:04.670
Omoide ni kaete

00:23:04.670 --> 00:23:08.880
Oikoshite susundeku

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:15.960
Ame ga yande kao o agete

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:21.880
"Arigatou" tte sunao ni waraeru hazu sa

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:25.330
Hello hello hello

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:34.130
Dareka no tame ai o utaou

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:39.830
"Adventure and the Unknown"
